exports[`formatToday with advice > Friday with legs heavy: reduced squat and a skippable Bulgarian 1`] = `
"<b>Week 5 · Strength</b> · Fri 30 Oct — Full-body strength
Thursday class: heavy LEGS

1. <b>Full-body warm-up</b> — 5 min easy bike + squat/press/row ramp-up sets
