   Squat: 90 kg
   <i>reduced to 2 × 4 (heavy legs Thursday) — or skip</i>
3. <b>Incline DB bench</b> — 3 × 6–8 · RIR 1–3
4. <b>Cable row or machine row</b> — 3 × 6–8 · RIR 1–3
5. <b>Bulgarian split squat</b> — 2 × 8/leg · RIR 1–3
   <i>can skip (heavy legs Thursday)</i>
6. <b>Face pull</b> — 2 × 12–15 · RIR 1–3
7. <b>Triceps extension</b> — 2 × 8–12 · RIR 1–3

≈ 43–44 min"
`;

